        <mxCell id="rules" value="&lt;b&gt;Tabelas de rotas&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pública: 10.0.0.0/16 → local; 0.0.0.0/0 → Internet Gateway&lt;br&gt;Privada: 10.0.0.0/16 → local (sem saída para a internet)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;togglemaster-ec2 (entrada)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TCP 80, 443 e 5000 ← 0.0.0.0/0&lt;br&gt;TCP 22 ← somente meu IP/32&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;togglemaster-rds (entrada)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TCP 5432 ← togglemaster-ec2" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBE6;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
